			"notes": "# 🚀 Emerald Gear Update\n\nThis update focuses on bringing full multiplayer compatibility, major code optimization under the hood, and cleaning up our overall codebase structure!\n\n## 🆕 What's New\n* **Full Multiplayer Support:** The mod is now completely server-safe! You can install it on dedicated servers and play with your friends without any registration crashes.\n* **Remade Textures:** Completely redesigned and polished the textures for all emerald gear, armor, and tools for a fresh, cleaner look in-game!\n\n\n## 🛠️ Code Refactoring & Performance\n* **Unified Item Management:** Merged all separate Tools, Weapons, and Armor classes into a single `ModItems` class to streamline adding future items.\n* **New Registration System:** Separated item registration logic into its own dedicated `ItemRegisterer` class, significantly improving code organization and readability.\n* **Optimized Villager Mixin:** Rewrote the villager discount mixin to reduce background processing and ensure much smoother performance when trading.\n\n\n## 📦 Compatibility\n* **Supported Versions:** `26.1` – `26.1.1`\n* **Required [Fabric API](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api) Version:** `0.145.2` or Above\n* **Required [Fabric Loader](https://fabricmc.net/) Version:** `0.19.3` or Above\n\n---\n\n### 💡 How to update:\nRemove the old `emeraldgear.jar` and Just drop the new `.jar` file into your `mods` folder."
		},
