			"notes": "# Emerald Gear\n\nEmerald Gear is my first Minecraft mod, adding emerald-based equipment and villager interactions.\n\n---\n\n## Added\n\n- Emerald armor set  \n  - Helmet  \n  - Chestplate  \n  - Leggings  \n  - Boots  \n\n- Emerald tools and weapons  \n\n- Villager discounts\n  - Discounts when wearing **any piece** of emerald armor\n  - Increased discounts when wearing a **full emerald armor set**\n  - Minor discounts when holding an **emerald gear item**\n\n- Villager gossip integration\n  - Wearing emerald gear grants positive villager gossip\n  - Positive gossip results in cheaper trades\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- Villager discounts currently work in **singleplayer only**\n- This is the **first public release**"
